# font.bend — font8x8_basic by Daniel Hepper, public domain.
# Generated by tools_gen_font2.py (preserved in project root) — do not hand-edit.
# font_byte(idx): idx = code*8 + row (0..1023) -> bitmap byte (U32 0..255).
# Bit 0 = leftmost pixel of the row (LSB-first, the font8x8 convention).
#
# Two-level dispatch (4 x 256 arms): a single 1024-arm U32 match
# OOMs Bend 2.0.18's native codegen (exit 137, verified 2026-09-20);
# 256-arm matches compile natively without issue.

